      "writtenOn": "2026-07-30T07:58:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "just to clarify, was this done to improve compatibility with the old yaml.v3 decoder, or to improve support for the YAML 1.1 spec? If the latter, we should file a bug and add a TODO. If just the former, and it\u0027s not a spec-required behavior, personally I\u0027d remove the workaround and let the experiment transition smooth over the change.",
      "revId": "eb382f79f17b74cb8b8dceef7d9e5e611d25ad18",
