      "writtenOn": "2026-07-30T15:19:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yep, agreed - will mention in the same issue as the other thingy.\n\n\u003e it does export the reserved short-tag strings as constants — token.MappingTag (\"!!map\"), token.SequenceTag, token.StringTag, etc. (token.ReservedTagKeyword) — but those exist for recognizing explicit tags in the source. There is no API answering \"what tag does this node resolve to\": no Node.Tag field, no ShortTag() equivalent.",
      "parentUuid": "11f7dc23_72970d68",
